        "content": "## Workflow Overview\nThis workflow:\n- Monitors Gmail for incoming PDF invoices\n- Extracts structured invoice data using Google Gemini\n- Classifies invoices as corporate or personal\n- Uploads them to separate Google Drive destinations\n- Records extracted metadata in Google Sheets"
